---
layout: layouts/base.njk
masthead: true
---
<div class="container">
  <section class="cover" aria-label="Introduction">
    <figure>
      <img src="/assets/images/headshot.jpg" alt="Portrait of David DeWinter smiling, wearing a blue gingham shirt" width="720" height="900" fetchpriority="high">
      <figcaption>David DeWinter has spent 15+ years leading product and engineering teams and starting companies.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <article class="feature">
      <span class="kicker">The work</span>
      <h2>Turning AI from a demo into <em>hours saved</em> every week</h2>
      <p class="dek">A builder and teacher on shipping products people rely on, and helping teams get real work done with AI.</p>
      <div class="byline">By <b>{{ site.name }}</b></div>
      <div class="feature-body">
        <p>For more than 15 years I've worked on both sides of building software: writing the code and deciding what's worth writing. I've led product teams, founded RowHero, and served as a Chief Product Officer.</p>
        <p>Today I run Northforge, where I teach real estate developers, investors, and law firms to use AI in their everyday work, and I host tech and AI tutorials for a 4.5M-subscriber channel.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="more" href="/about/">More about me →</a>
    </article>

    <aside class="numbers">
      <h2>By the numbers</h2>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>4.5M</dt><dd>subscribers on the channel I teach for</dd></div>
        <div><dt>35+</dt><dd>teams using RowHero, 100% retention</dd></div>
        <div><dt>$35M</dt><dd>revenue, up from $17M, during my time as CPO</dd></div>
        <div><dt>10 → 1</dt><dd>hours for a research task, rebuilt with AI</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <div class="issue-head">
    <h2>In this issue: projects</h2>
    <a href="/projects/">All projects →</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="issue">
    {%- set n = 0 %}
    {%- for project in projects %}{% if project.featured %}
    {%- set n = n + 1 %}
    <li>
      <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">0{{ n }}</span>
      <h3><a href="/projects/#{{ project.title | slugify }}">{{ project.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ project.summary }}</p>
      <p class="meta">{{ project.role }} · {{ project.years }}</p>
    </li>
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>

  {%- set latest = collections.posts | first %}
  {%- if latest %}
  <section class="essay{% if not latest.data.pullquote %} no-quote{% endif %}" aria-label="Latest writing">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Latest essay</span>
      <h2><a href="{{ latest.url }}">{{ latest.data.title }}</a></h2>
      {%- if latest.data.description %}<p>{{ latest.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
      <a class="more" href="{{ latest.url }}">Read the essay →</a>
      {%- if collections.posts.length > 1 %} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <a class="more" href="/blog/">All writing →</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {%- if latest.data.pullquote %}
    <blockquote>
      {{ latest.data.pullquote }}
      <cite>From “{{ latest.data.title }}”</cite>
    </blockquote>
    {%- endif %}
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  <section class="letters" aria-label="Contact">
    <span class="kicker">Letters</span>
    <h2>Write to me</h2>
    <p>Working on something where AI could save your team real time, or just want to compare notes? I read every message.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
  </section>
</div>
